WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.792 --> 00:00:04.293
HUNTER B-15
Loki, not a threat.

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:06.832
LOKI
I beg your pardon?

00:00:06.882 --> 00:00:10.094
♪♪

00:00:10.144 --> 00:00:12.753
TOM HIDDLESTON
What I love about playing Loki,

00:00:12.803 --> 00:00:15.338
he plays all the
keys on the piano.

00:00:15.388 --> 00:00:16.306
LOKI
Enough.

00:00:19.193 --> 00:00:21.069
MOBIUS
See, I can play the heavy keys too.

00:00:21.811 --> 00:00:23.058
KATE HERRON
Something I always try and bring to

00:00:23.108 --> 00:00:25.159
everything I do is
digging into the emotion

00:00:25.209 --> 00:00:25.808
LOKI
I'm a God.

00:00:25.858 --> 00:00:27.104
SYLVIE
You're a clown.

00:00:27.154 --> 00:00:29.206
KATE HERRON
Letting the characters be ugly in a way,

00:00:29.256 --> 00:00:30.840
for me it feels a bit more real.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.033
MOBIUS
Glorious purpose!

00:00:33.623 --> 00:00:35.450
AUTUMN DURALD ARKAPAW
The world the production designers created

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.709
is very unique for Loki,
it has a lot of texture.

00:00:40.162 --> 00:00:42.011
CHRISTINE WADA
Thank God that Loki and the MCU

00:00:42.061 --> 00:00:44.683
has a sense of
humor for inspiration.

00:00:44.733 --> 00:00:46.561
KEVIN R. WRIGHT
It was fun, it was weird,

00:00:46.611 --> 00:00:49.983
we were able to create
all these bandit versions of Loki.

00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:52.283
TOM HIDDLESTON
I feel like I'm having an identity crisis.

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:57.632
TOM HIDDLESTON
We have this amazing story

00:00:57.682 --> 00:01:00.106
that's actually about
coming to terms with who you are.

00:01:00.156 --> 00:01:04.527
I feel very grateful that I'm part of
a project that I think has probably

00:01:04.577 --> 00:01:08.692
changed the direction of the MCU,
and I really want the fans to feel excited

00:01:08.742 --> 00:01:11.208
and inspired about
where we go next.

